@baseUrl = http://localhost:5051

### 1. Hello World workflow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/hello?name=Leadership

### 2. Small expense -> auto-approved
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employee": "Asha", "email": "asha@example.com", "amount": 250, "description": "Team lunch" }

### 3. Large expense -> waits for a manager decision
# @name bigExpense
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "employee": "Ravi", "email": "ravi@example.com", "amount": 4500, "description": "Conference trip" }

### 4. Check status (Running / Suspended)
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/expenses/{{bigExpense.response.body.workflowInstanceId}}

### 5a. Approve
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/expenses/{{bigExpense.response.body.workflowInstanceId}}/approve

### 5b. ...or reject
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/expenses/{{bigExpense.response.body.workflowInstanceId}}/reject

### 6. Check status again (Finished)
GET {{baseUrl}}/demo/expenses/{{bigExpense.response.body.workflowInstanceId}}
